        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "16-8-3 One (1) conference each school year shall be held between the teacher and the evaluator immediately prior to the initial firsthand observation (Section 16-8) at either party's request. At such conference, the parties may discuss curriculum objectives and goals, learning outcomes, techniques to be used to supply students feedback on their performance, lesson plans, classroom activities scheduled, the educational environment and other areas of performance the teacher may wish the evaluator to observe.",
